+<div class="accordion-item"><h3 class="accordion-q">Relying on Zillow neighborhood data instead of local knowledge</h3><div class="accordion-a"><p>Zillow's neighborhood ratings do not reflect the block-by-block differences in the Grand Strand market. A zip code that looks average in the statistics may contain a top-rated school district, a golf-cart-friendly community, or a high-performing STR corridor. Ask your agent for a block-by-block breakdown before drawing conclusions from online ratings.</p></div></div>
