 <h2 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:2rem;margin-bottom:1rem">Mistakes Retirees Make</h2>
 <p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:2rem;max-width:680px">These are the retiree-specific ones. The full list for every buyer type is here: <a href="/buyers/common-mistakes/" style="color:var(--brass);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none">common Myrtle Beach buyer mistakes</a>.</p>
 <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column">
